  1898,
  $skt$https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1669040084821-097235fe53ff?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80$skt$,
  $skt$Portrait of a Black woman wearing decorative earrings$skt$,
  $skt$William Boateng$skt$,
  $skt$https://unsplash.com/@william_boateng?utm_source=SkinLabs&utm_medium=referral$skt$,
