  1956,
  $skt$https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1746227638992-50b1e1e0d96b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80$skt$,
  $skt$Facial cleanser tube resting on natural driftwood$skt$,
  $skt$Ela De Pure$skt$,
  $skt$https://unsplash.com/@eladepure?utm_source=SkinLabs&utm_medium=referral$skt$,
  '[]'::jsonb,
  $skt$Retinol vs Retinaldehyde: Which Works Faster?$skt$,
  $skt$A plain-English comparison of retinol and retinaldehyde, covering conversion pathways, potency, tolerance and how to introduce either safely.$skt$,
