  $skt$A bowl of yogurt with fresh fruit alongside a cup of coffee$skt$,
  $skt$Brooke Lark$skt$,
  $skt$https://unsplash.com/@brookelark?utm_source=SkinLabs&utm_medium=referral$skt$,
