  $skt$https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1691031319052-80a0fa7396c5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80$skt$,
  $skt$A woman in a sun hat at the beach on a bright day$skt$,
  $skt$Sarah Sheedy$skt$,
