  $skt$A woman standing alone on a rocky Cape Town beach at sunrise$skt$,
  $skt$adriaan venner scheepers$skt$,
  $skt$https://unsplash.com/@venner?utm_source=SkinLabs&utm_medium=referral$skt$,
